{"des":"漂流而来的小麦-战斗结束后","script":"s_5_13_4","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好……把它们打退了。教授，您没事吧？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我没事……非常感谢你们。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我刚刚想到了，这些小麦能成长……可能正和和这些魔物有关系。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你们看，这些小麦周身的魔力非常平衡，甚至都没有受过霜害真菌的感染！这显然是有他者参与养护的结果！[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊……啊啊，是这样啊！我明白了！——这些小麦正是因芙洛波和冰棱妖精的活动，偶然得到成长的！[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]芙洛波在附近的挖掘为它松了土，同时翻上来不少带有火属性魔力的岩石；冰棱妖精在附近的穿梭，驱散了土质中的冰害真菌，也激活、锻炼着我们之前在作物里改良过的抗冻因子……[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这么说……这小麦还是人类和魔物共同培育的成果？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你说得没错，这是我们人类与魔物共同培育的成果！这种能在冰雪中生长的小麦堪称奇迹，我这就回去请求院卫，务必保护好这片田地。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]至于这几株小麦……我取些样本就回去了，还是不要惊扰这群魔物为好。既然是它们培育了小麦，那我们理应心存感激，与它们和平共处。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯，我也觉得这样做比较合适。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过……为了防止空穗壳继续飘向温泉村，你还是得想个清理垃圾的办法吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这很简单，弄张网就行了，或者安排人值守。反正我们也要在这边投入资源，顺便清理一下垃圾也不是什么难事。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]请放心，我们很快就能让这片雪地种满小麦。到时候大家再也不会缺粮食了！霜烬平原的居民们一定能过上更好的生活。[l][cm]","charaName":"农野系教授乌米"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]加油！我们也很期待哦！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}